    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eliya kūliishiwa ng'hūngūūlū",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna wilonga Eliya muna Tishibe, ūmò wa bikaji ba Tishibe ya Gileadi, ūng'wīla ū Ahabu, “Nalīkwilahīlīla mu lina lya ng'wa SEEBA mpanga, ū Mulungu wa Isilaeli ūyo nalī ntūmami wakwe,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17:1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ūyo nalī ntūmami wakwe:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, ūyo nakīmīīlaga kū būtongi bokwe.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " lūtūūgwa lūme hasī nūūlū mbula ītūūtūla ū mu myaka īyo īliza yenīyī, ūlū nene natayombile mhayo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA gūng'wizīīla ū Eliya kūng'wīla, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Īngaga a henaha, ūje ūkibise kū kamongo ka Keliti, kīya ya Yolodani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A minzī ū kūyūng'wa kūfuma ū mu kamongo kenako; ī shilīwa ī shene najilagīlaga ng'hūngūūlū jikūyūkwenhela koi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'hana wīta gīt'ūmo gūkang'wīlīla ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA; ūja ū kū kamongo ka Keliti, ī kīya ya Yolodani, ūkikala kwenūko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ng'hūngūūlū jūyūng'wenhela ngatī na nyama dilū na mhīndī; a minzī wang'welaga kūfuma ū mu kamongo kenako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike aho jabīta shikū, a kamongo kūūkama, nguno yalī ītatūlaga ī mbula.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eliya na nkīma wa Zalefati",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA gūng'wzīīla gūlīng'wīla gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Būūkaga ī haha yenīyī jaga Zalefati ya Sidoni ūkikale kwenūko. Alīko nkīma wachīlwa ngoshi nanagīlaga kūkūpandīkīla shilīwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbūūka ng'hana ū Eliya ūja ī Zalefati, aho washika a ha mita gwa nzengo gwenūyo, ūmona nkīma akūsolelejaga ng'hwi. Ūngīsha, hūna ūnomba alīhaya, “Mayū ūdūgije kūnigunanha minzī mageehu ng'wisale nang'we?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nkīma ng'wenūyo aho alīja ū kwenha a minzī, ūng'witana hangī ūng'wīla, “Mayū ni wanilolalolela na ka shipande ka ngatī nalye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nkīma ng'wenūyo ūhaya, “Baba ūmo SEEBA Mulungu wako alī mpanga, ū nene natī na ngatī gete nūūlū hado; nalī na tū būsu tūgehu dūhū mu kashilīndo, na tūguta twa gīko gīko mu jūbba. Ī haha nalīsoleleja ū tūkwi twenūtū naje nakatūzuge ūto tūlīho twenūūto, nalye na kitūnja kane; twigobbole tūche na kūcha!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Eliya ūng'wīla gīkī ū nkīma ng'wenūyo, “Ūlītūngīlīja mayū, jaga ūkīīte ūmo wahayīla, alīyo ū mu shenīsho wasaajaga nibeegejage tame ū nene kangatī ūnenhele; hanuma ya henaho ūkūbeeja nī sha kūlya ū bebe nū ng'witūnja wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū SEEBA ū Mulungu wa Isilaeli alīhaya gīkī, ‘Ī shilīndo shitūmala ū būsu, nī jūbba ya maguta ītūkama, kūshisha lūshikū lwa ng'wa SEEBA kwenha mbula ītūle ū mu sī.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mayū ng'wenūyo ūja ng'hana ūkīīta gīt'ūmo akawīlīlwa nū Eliya. Na lūūlū shūbiza ho shilīwa sha kūnisha ū Eliya nū nkīma ng'wenūyo nī kaya yakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shilīndo shitamalile ū būsu, nī jūbba ya maguta ītakamile, kūlenganīla nū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA ūyo akagūhaya ū Eliya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya makanza malebe ūsaata ū ng'witūnja wa nkīma ū ng'wenekīlī kaya yenīyo; ū būsaatu būkūla kūshisha ūcha! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nkīma ng'wenūyo ūng'wīla ū Eliya, “Bebe munhū o ng'wa Mulungu, ū nene naakūkenije mhayo kī nose wizile kūniizūkīja būhūbi wane, gīkī ūnibūlagīle ū ng'wana wane!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Eliya ūng'wīla, “Alinenhelage ū ng'wana wako!” Aho wang'wanukūla kūfuma ū mu nkono gwakwe, ūmūcha ūja nang'hwe kū chūmba sha kwigūlya ūko walaalaga; ūnaalīkīja a ha būlīīlī bokwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūnīlīīla ū SEEBA alīhaya, “Ee SEEBA Mulungu wane, nū nkīma ng'wenūyū, ū nchīlwa ūyo nalikala ha ng'wakwe wangwisīja mhayo gwabūbi gīkī, gwa kūmūlaga ū ng'witūnja wakwe!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūlaala a higūlya ya mīlī gwa nyanda ng'wenūyo, wigoloola hoi ng'hangala idatū; hanuma ūnīlīīla ū SEEBA alīhaya, “Ee SEEBA Mulungu wane, nalīkwikūmbīlīja būnshokele ū būpanga wakwe ū nyanda ng'wenūyū!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA wigwa ū kūlomba kwa ng'wa Eliya, būnshokela hangī ū būpanga wakwe ū nyanda; ūbiza mpanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Eliya ūmūcha ū nyanda kūfuma ū mu chumba, ūntwala mu numba ūūkang'winha ū nina kūnū alīng'wīla, “Alilolaga ūūyū ū ng'wana wako mpanga!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nkīma ūng'wīla ū Eliya, “Ī haha lūūlū hū namana gīkī gashi ng'hana ūlī munhū o ng'wa Mulungu, nī gīkī ū mhayo go ng'wa Mulungu ūyo gūkafumaga ū mu nomo gwako gūlī gwa ng'hana.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
